summary.label:
It is a software that allows you to view CAD files on your cell phone. You can quickly import CAD files and view them anywhere on your cell phone, and there is a file management function that allows you to manage multiple files in a clear and convenient way.

Subscription:
1、Users can use unlimited access to view CAD drawings, file management and other functions only through paid subscription;
2. The subscription fee will be deducted from the iTunes account when the user confirms the purchase and can be renewed automatically for $39.99/year;
3. users can turn off auto-renewal 24 hours before the end of the current subscription, otherwise the subscription will be automatically renewed;
4. the Apple ID of the automatically renewed subscription will be automatically deducted from the iTunes account 24 hours before the expiration of each billing cycle and the corresponding validity period will be extended;
5. Users manage the subscription service, i.e., they can go to their user accounts to set off automatic subscriptions after purchase.

